  - m_Id: 13060448239738880
    m_Localized: "WASD \u2014 to move.\n\nUse E to open doors, pick up items, and
      interact with objects.\n\nUse Q to throw an item on the ground.\n\nUse F to
      activate the item in your hands.\n\nUse the mouse wheel (or 1 2 3 4) to select
      an inventory slot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13061208377647104
    m_Localized: 'Hurry up.


      Guests will be arriving soon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13061055474294784
    m_Localized: 'Note: Keep track of Nest monsters nests'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13060990374502400
    m_Localized: 'A nest monster lives here.



      Don''t disturb it.



      Periodiclly
      leave it an apple by the door.



      Otherwise, it will come out to look
      for food on its own.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13060948565680128
    m_Localized: 'There''s a dog living in this house.

      

      It''s best
      to avoid its presence.

      

      If it sees you, you won''t be able
      to escape.

      

      It can hear your footsteps; hold Ctrl to sneak.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13060830516994048
    m_Localized: 'Camera operating instructions:


      1) Attach the camera to
      the corner of the room

      2) While you''re holding the camera tablet, you
      can see everything that all cameras can see.

      3) To view distant cameras,
      press F while holding the camera tablet and use the mouse wheel to select the
      desired camera.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13060700061556736
    m_Localized: 'Escape Plan:


      Boxes appear around the house at night.

      Collect
      6 boxes.

      Build a ladder from the boxes to reach the exit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13077440430596096
    m_Localized: press F to close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13134840212910080
    m_Localized: Apples appear here periodically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13160598979207168
    m_Localized: Hub
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13160563017244672
    m_Localized: 'Level 1

      Home sweet home'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13160587067383808
    m_Localized: 'Level 2

      Basement'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13465043457794048
    m_Localized: Thanks for playing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17942413623418880
    m_Localized: Restart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17945137765146624
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17945151660875776
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17945197055827968
    m_Localized: Are you sure you want to restart the level?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19140828776620032
    m_Localized: 'Use the alarm clock to distract monsters.



      To set the alarm
      clock for +1 second, press F while holding it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19140856282865664
    m_Localized: 'Use the planks to barricade the door.



      To do this, press
      E on the door while holding the planks.



      This will make it take the
      monster longer to open it.



      The planks can be reused.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19538310983573504
    m_Localized: 'Level 3

      Factory'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19622315602993152
    m_Localized: You win!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19622482959917056
    m_Localized: 'Game by

      AhhVasa - Programming

      Prjx - Music

      Imaduckmahdude
      - 2d Art

'
